sequenceDiagram
    participant MB as Mainboard
    participant MC as ModuleController
    participant PM as PluginManager
    participant CMP as Component
    participant ND as Node
    participant TR as Transport
    participant DS as Dispatcher
    participant RC as Receiver
    participant RD as Reader
    participant SCH as Scheduler
    participant CR as CRoutine
    participant SRV as ServiceDiscovery
    participant WR as Writer

    MB->>MC: parse DAG & args, Init()
    MC->>PM: request load modules
    PM->>CMP: instantiate component (from plugin)
    CMP->>ND: CreateReader/CreateWriter/CreateService
    ND->>SRV: register role/topology
    ND->>TR: CreateReceiver/CreateTransmitter
    TR->>DS: dispatch to appropriate dispatcher (INTRA/SHM/RTPS)
    DS->>RC: deliver messages to receiver
    RC->>RD: push message to Reader queue
    RD->>SCH: notify scheduler / create task (CRoutine)
    SCH->>CR: schedule/run CRoutine
    CR->>CMP: call Proc() (component processing)
    CMP->>WR: write output message
    WR->>TR: transmit (INTRA/SHM/RTPS)
    TR->>DS: routing to other receivers (loop)

